<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Etec Systems raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Etec Systems raised.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>SoundView Financial Group Inc said analyst Michael O'Brien upgraded Etec Systems Inc to short-term buy from hold.</p>
<p>-- said the long-term rating remains unchanged at buy.</p>
<p>-- said raised the fiscal year 1998 earnings estimate to $2.62 a share from $2.53 a share.</p>
<p>-- Etec gained 3-5/8 to 45-1/2.</p>
</text>
